---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Voice DNA — Make Claude Sound Like You | 72° AI Labs"
  description="Free template to configure Claude to match your actual writing voice. Eliminate AI-isms in 10 minutes. Set once, works across every conversation."
>
  <Nav />

  <main id="main-content">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">Free Template</p>
        <h1>Stop Sounding Like An AI</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">
          Configure Claude to match your actual writing voice. Set once, forget about it.
        </p>

        <div class="stats-row">
          <div class="stat">
            <span class="stat-number">10</span>
            <span class="stat-label">minutes to set up</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-divider"></div>
          <div class="stat">
            <span class="stat-number">50+</span>
            <span class="stat-label">banned AI phrases</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-divider"></div>
          <div class="stat">
            <span class="stat-number">free</span>
            <span class="stat-label">no strings attached</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="/voice-dna.md" download="voice-dna.md" class="btn-primary">
            Download Template
          </a>
          <a href="#how-it-works" class="btn-ghost">How it works</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Problem -->
    <section class="section-alt">
      <div class="container narrow">
        <h2>The problem</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          You've felt it. That subtle wrongness when you read something Claude wrote for you.
          The structure is solid. The facts are right. But it doesn't sound like you.
        </p>
        <p class="lead">
          Voice DNA fixes this. It's a configuration file that tells Claude how you write:
          your sentence rhythms, your hedging style, your banned phrases.
          Add your own writing samples and Claude pattern-matches against your actual voice.
        </p>

        <div class="compare-block">
          <div class="compare-item bad">
            <span class="compare-label">Default Claude</span>
            <p>"In today's rapidly evolving AI landscape, it's worth noting that leveraging
            these cutting-edge tools can help you unlock significant productivity gains."</p>
          </div>
          <div class="compare-item good">
            <span class="compare-label">Voice DNA Claude</span>
            <p>"AI tools save time if you configure them right."</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="caption">Both say the same thing. One sounds human.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- What's inside -->
    <section class="section" id="how-it-works">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>What's inside</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">The template has three sections. The first two work immediately. The third is where your voice comes in.</p>

        <div class="feature-grid">
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-number">01</div>
            <h3>Writing rules</h3>
            <p>Sentence structure, hedging, specificity, paragraph length. Rules that eliminate the most obvious AI patterns without making the output feel constrained.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-number">02</div>
            <h3>Banned phrases</h3>
            <p>50+ phrases that instantly signal AI wrote this. "Delve," "leverage," "cutting-edge," engagement bait, and the fatal negation-correction pattern.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-number">03</div>
            <h3>Writing samples</h3>
            <p>Paste 3-5 samples of your pre-AI writing. Claude pattern-matches against these. The more you give, the better the voice match.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Code preview -->
        <div class="code-preview">
          <div class="code-header">
            <span class="code-filename">voice-dna.md</span>
            <a href="/voice-dna.md" download="voice-dna.md" class="code-download">Download</a>
          </div>
          <pre class="code-body"><span class="code-heading"># Voice DNA</span>

<span class="code-heading">## Writing Rules</span>
- Get to the point. No throat-clearing.
- Vary sentence length. Mix short and long.
- When uncertain, say so. Hedging is human.
- Use physical verbs: "sanded down" not "improved"
- Never pad output.

<span class="code-heading">## Banned Phrases</span>
- Delve / Dive into / Unpack
- Leverage / Harness / Utilize
- Game-changer / Cutting-edge
- "This isn't X. This is Y." <span class="code-comment">(FATAL — never use)</span>

<span class="code-heading">## Writing Samples</span>
[Paste your pre-AI writing here...]</pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Implementation -->
    <section class="section-alt">
      <div class="container narrow">
        <h2>3 ways to use it</h2>

        <div class="impl-list">
          <div class="impl-item">
            <div class="impl-num">1</div>
            <div class="impl-body">
              <h3>User Preferences <span class="badge">Recommended</span></h3>
              <p>Settings → Profile → User preferences → paste content → save.</p>
              <p class="impl-note">Applies globally. Works across every conversation automatically.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="impl-item">
            <div class="impl-num">2</div>
            <div class="impl-body">
              <h3>Project Custom Instructions</h3>
              <p>Add to a Claude Project's knowledge. Set custom instructions to apply it.</p>
              <p class="impl-note">Good for work that needs consistent voice within a specific project.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="impl-item">
            <div class="impl-num">3</div>
            <div class="impl-body">
              <h3>Per-Conversation Prompt</h3>
              <p>Paste at the start of any conversation.</p>
              <p class="impl-note">One-off use. Doesn't carry over to new conversations.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="impl-note-box">
          <p><strong>A note on writing samples:</strong> Use pre-AI writing. If you've been using AI for a while, your recent writing already has AI fingerprints. Go back to 2022 or earlier — Google Docs, sent emails, old Slack threads.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container narrow center">
        <h2>Get the template</h2>
        <p class="lead">Free. No signup required. Download and configure in 10 minutes.</p>
        <a href="/voice-dna.md" download="voice-dna.md" class="btn-primary">
          Download voice-dna.md
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Newsletter -->
    <section class="section-dark">
      <div class="container narrow center">
        <h2>More like this</h2>
        <p class="lead-light">
          Weekly guides on making AI work in practice. No fluff, just implementations
          that have shipped.
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSemoTVzlHx6-w1U14b_rcMArAgV4s8jd5EoFYMqlMX6uhGiPQ/viewform"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="btn-subscribe"
        >
          Subscribe — it's free
        </a>
        <p class="form-note">Opens Google Form. Your email is never shared. Unsubscribe anytime.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  /* Layout */
  .container {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
  }
  .container.narrow {
    max-width: 720px;
  }
  .container.center {
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Hero */
  .hero {
    background: var(--bg);
    padding: 5rem 0 4rem;
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #0C1A3F;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    color: var(--text-2);
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
    max-width: 560px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .stats-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .stat {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .stat-number {
    display: block;
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #DDA744;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .stat-divider {
    width: 1px;
    height: 40px;
    background: var(--border);
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  /* Buttons */
  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #0C1A3F;
    color: white;
    padding: 0.875rem 2.25rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.15s;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: #1a2d5a;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  }

  .btn-ghost {
    display: inline-block;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text-2);
    padding: 0.875rem 2.25rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;
  }

  .btn-ghost:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-hover);
    color: var(--text);
  }

  /* Sections */
  .section {
    padding: 5rem 0;
    background: var(--bg);
  }

  .section-alt {
    padding: 5rem 0;
    background: var(--surface);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .section-dark {
    padding: 5rem 0;
    background: #0C1A3F;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-3xl);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #0C1A3F;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .section-dark h2 {
    color: white;
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--text-2);
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
    max-width: 600px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .lead-light {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
  }

  .caption {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
  }

  /* Compare */
  .compare-block {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0;
  }

  .compare-item {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .compare-item.bad {
    background: #fef2f2;
    border-color: #fecaca;
  }

  .compare-item.good {
    background: #f0fdf4;
    border-color: #bbf7d0;
  }

  .compare-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .compare-item.bad .compare-label { color: #dc2626; }
  .compare-item.good .compare-label { color: #16a34a; }

  .compare-item p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Feature grid */
  .feature-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin: 0 0 4rem;
  }

  .feature-card {
    padding: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .feature-number {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #DDA744;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #0C1A3F;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .feature-card p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Code preview */
  .code-preview {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .code-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 0.875rem 1.25rem;
    background: #f1f5f9;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .code-filename {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
  }

  .code-download {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .code-download:hover {
    color: var(--accent-hover);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .code-body {
    background: #0C1A3F;
    color: #e2e8f0;
    padding: 2rem;
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
    overflow-x: auto;
    white-space: pre;
  }

  .code-heading {
    color: #DDA744;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .code-comment {
    color: #64748b;
  }

  /* Implementation */
  .impl-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--bg);
  }

  .impl-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .impl-item:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .impl-num {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #DDA744;
    color: white;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.1rem;
  }

  .impl-body {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .impl-body h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #0C1A3F;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .impl-body p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-2);
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .impl-note {
    font-size: var(--text-sm) !important;
    color: var(--text-3) !important;
  }

  .badge {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    background: #DDA744;
    color: white;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .impl-note-box {
    background: #eff6ff;
    border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .impl-note-box p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #1e40af;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .impl-note-box strong {
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* Newsletter */
  .btn-subscribe {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #DDA744;
    color: #0C1A3F;
    padding: 0.9rem 2.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.15s;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .btn-subscribe:hover {
    background: #c49038;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .form-note {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .stat-divider { display: none; }

    .compare-block {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .feature-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .impl-item {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 3.5rem 0 3rem;
    }

    .section,
    .section-alt,
    .section-dark {
      padding: 3.5rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>